    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d883">

                <pb facs="0994" n="850" sameAs="frus:frus1929v02/pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">031.11 American Museum of Natural History (4th
                    Asiatic)/57</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-07-12">July 12, 1929</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Chinese Minister brought up the question of the Andrews Expedition and told
                    me that what he thought was the last doubt had been dissolved; that the Chinese
                    had given up their claim to have a Chinese co-director go with the
                    Expedition.</p>
            </div>
